<title>PAKISTAN: Pakistan yarn rates ease as cotton prices fall.</title>
<headline>Pakistan yarn rates ease as cotton prices fall.</headline>
<dateline>KARACHI, Pakistan 1997-01-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pakistani cotton yarn rates eased on Sunday as cotton prices fell in local markets, dealers said. Rates were likely to fall in the next few days.</p>
<p>Following are the rates in rupees supplied by the Pakistan Yarn Merchants Association for 10-lb (4.54 kg) cone of 21</p>
<p>counts:			    Sunday	Jan 22</p>
<p>    Al-Karam		     490	   500</p>
<p>    Taj Textile		  500	   510</p>
<p>    Baig			   480	   490</p>
<p>($1 = 40.22 rupees) -- Karachi newsroom 9221-5685192</p>
</text>
